{"availability":"available","full":"AllRates-Today/central-bank-rates-demo","name":"central-bank-rates-demo","description":"Official exchange rates from 34 central banks — sample site using one npm SDK per bank (AllRatesToday API)","category":"Developer tools","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-08-07T14:40:20Z","updated":"2026-08-13T10:26:14Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://allrates-today.github.io/central-bank-rates-demo/","topics":["central-bank","currency-api","demo","exchange-rates","forex","nodejs"],"demo":"https://allrates-today.github.io/central-bank-rates-demo/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T12:59:52.939Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T12:59:52.939Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T12:59:52.939Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T12:59:52.939Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Node.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A sample static site that pulls the official published exchange-rate tables from 34 central banks — one npm package per bank — and renders them as a single self-contained dashboard. Built for developers evaluating the AllRatesToday Central Bank Rates API who want to see the per-bank SDKs actually working before writing any code.","[]( []( []( [](.github/workflows/deploy.yml) [](package.json) [](banks.mjs) [](package.json)","These are the bank-published reference rates used for tax, customs, audit and compliant invoicing — not market ticks. Each response carries the bank's own publication date (ratedate)."],"features":["🏦 34 central banks, 34 npm packages — every card on the page is produced by a different SDK; the import is the demo","📦 Zero-dependency SDKs — each -exchange-rate package is a thin fetch wrapper over the API, no transitive deps","🗓️ Daily rebuild — a scheduled GitHub Actions workflow regenerates and redeploys the page every day at 06:30 UTC","🔒 Key never shipped — the API key is read from an Actions secret at build time and never appears in the repo